        "type": "thinking",
        "thinking": "I recall रूप is classified as an adanta root in the कथादि group, so it doesn't take vrddhi/guna in the same way, and since it's not aglopī, it wouldn't need the स् insertion in the caṅ-luṅ formation.\n\nSo reduplicating रूप as रुरूप gives अरुरूपत् in the third person singular, with no upadha hrasva because of the अग्लोपि restriction (7.4.2). I'll go with the parasmaipada form, giving अरुरूपताम् for the dual.\n\n",
